se County","date":"","retrievedAt":"2026-09-04","kind":"OFFICIAL","limitation":"Dynamic map linked by County Planning. Complete current parcel/overlay extraction did not succeed in this research session."},{"id":"CO-PARCEL","title":"County parcel/tax GIS layer","url":"https://services6.arcgis.com/Yxem0VOcqSy8T6TE/arcgis/rest/services/Cad_Parcel_TaxInfo/FeatureServer/0","publisher":"Cochise County GIS","date":"","retrievedAt":"2026-09-04","kind":"OFFICIAL","limitation":"Layer metadata identified. Exact-feature query was blocked in the research browser; geometry is not claimed as freshly retrieved."},{"id":"BEN-PRIOR","title":"Benson hostile and precontact due-diligence reports","url":"","publisher":"Syncranicity project File Library","date":"2026-09-04","retrievedAt":"2026-09-04","kind":"PRIOR_REPORT","limitation":"Inherited AI research, not a substitute for the underlying county, deed, survey, well or utility document. Conflicts are retained."},{"id":"BEN-CALL","title":"Founder report of county conversations","url":"","publisher":"Founder / county staff as reported by founder","date":"2026-09-04","retrievedAt":"2026-09-04","kind":"USER_REPORT","limitation":"Oral information: 115.45 versus 106.92 acres, road N Aacco Trail, unmaintained road and approximately 50-foot easement. Width and public status not independently established."},{"id":"SSVEC","title":"SSVEC official website","url":"https://www.ssvec.org/","publisher":"SSVEC","date":"","retrievedAt":"2026-09-04","kind":"OFFICIAL","limitation":"Potential utility contact, not exact parcel territory or available MW confirmation."}],"actions":[{"id":"az-cochise-12002003a-a1","order":1,"title":"Resolve legal parcel, offered portion and road record","contact":"Cochise Planning / GIS, then assessor/recorder","channel":"County Planning: 520-432-9300; planning@cochise.az.gov","question":"For APN 120-02-003A, which deed, survey and recorded road instrument explain 115.45 versus 106.92 acres and N Aacco Trail? Does the 50-foot number describe a recorded public right-of-way, private easement or merely a GIS attribute?","decision":"Kill or continue the land-layout thesis without paying for an option.","costEstimate":"$0 desktop / no fee authorized","approvalRequired":true,"done":false,"recordId":"az-cochise-12002003a"},{"id":"az-cochise-12002003a-a2","order":2,"title":"Obtain source documents already held by seller","contact":"Current listing broker / Fenner L.L.C. authorized representative","channel":"Use the existing verified listing contact; do not guess an email","question":"Provide the current legal description, all APNs offered, survey, title exceptions, road/easement instruments and authorization to make public-record and utility inquiries. Is 90/103/13 acres a legal split, excluded area, or alternate marketing?","decision":"Define the contract asset and seller cooperation.","costEstimate":"Request existing documents at $0; any title/survey quote needs approval.","approvalRequired":true,"done":false,"recordId":"az-cochise-12002003a"},{"id":"az-cochise-12002003a-a3","order":3,"title":"Get a written use-path answer, not a generic zoning answer","contact":"Cochise Planning","channel":"520-432-9300; planning@cochise.az.gov","question":"After the boundary/road exhibit is assembled, which current provisions apply to this specific electricity-intensive industrial use, including generators, cooling, noise, water and setbacks? Please identify the governing section and any additional overlays.","decision":"Bound the entitlement route and layout exclusions.","costEstimate":"$0 desktop / no fee authorized","approvalRequired":true,"done":false,"recordId":"az-cochise-12002003a"},{"id":"az-cochise-12002003a-a4","order":4,"title":"Confirm utility process only after owner authority / geometry","contact":"SSVEC large-load / engineering intake","channel":"Official SSVEC contact route: https://www.ssvec.org/","question":"Does SSVEC serve this exact APN? Can an authorized option holder request a preliminary large-load screen, and what owner authorization, customer credit, studies and deposits are needed? No capacity promise is requested.","decision":"Determine whether a sponsor-funded studyable path exists.","costEstimate":"No paid application or deposit authorized.","approvalRequired":true,"done":false,"recordId":"az-cochise-12002003a"}],"geometry":null,"geometrySource":"","location":{"lon":-110.235361,"lat":31.969801,"precision":"PRIOR_REPORT_LOCATOR_NOT_CURRENT_SURVEY"},"kill":null,"history":[{"at":"2026-09-04","action":"RECOVERED_AND_REVIEWED","note":"Original lead retained. Fresh sources, inherited claims and unsuccessful retrievals separated."},{"at":"2026-09-05T18:00:00Z","action":"WORKFLOW_V3_MIGRATION","before":"Original preserved in immutable import","after":"PRIORITY","note":"Traceable exact APN in Cochise with inherited marketed offering, owner record and electricity-intensive use hypothesis. Attributable SSVEC/process and substation leads exist as provisional signals. No supported incurable fatality established; a precise public-record/geometry test is inexpensive and decisive.","source":"COUNTY_GIS_WORKFLOW_V3.md; inherited research as of 2026-09-04"}],"notes":"","mapVisible":true,"baseline":true,"priority_tier":"PRIORITY","workflow_stage":"GIS_QUEUED","evidence_status":"INHERITED / CONFLICT","capital_status":"HOLD","opportunityId":"az-cochise-12002003a","noteEntries":[],"categoryReason":"Traceable exact APN in Cochise with inherited marketed offering, owner record and electricity-intensive use hypothesis. Attributable SSVEC/process and substation leads exist as provisional signals. No supported incurable fatality established; a precise public-record/geometry test is inexpensive and decisive.","initialScreen":{"traceableAsset":true,"plausibleEconomics":true,"powerSignal":true,"buyerFit":true,"noSupportedFatal":true,"nextTest":true,"alternateUse":true},"alternateUse":"Low-water industrial or ordinary rural use is a hypothesis only; land-use permission, access, market demand and downside value remain unproved.","buyerFit":"Buyer class hypothesis: low-water industrial / phased compute. No named buyer mandate, committed MW or confirmed acquisition interest."},{"id":"ca-sanjoaquin-01322013","name":"Acampo — parcel 13","recordType":"PARCEL","apn":"013-220-13","state":"CA","county":"San Joaquin","origin":"Recovered prior Syncranicity lead; updated desktop review","updatedAt":"2026-09-04","lifecycle":"ACTIVE","summary":"A documented industrial land-use history makes this worth targeted review, but it is one half of the same Acampo assemblage, not a separate independent opportunity. The access condition, neighboring homes, agricultural mitigation, utility service and data-center treatment remain open. Hold option money.","thesis":"Re-use the historical industrial conversion only if a low-water, buyer-sized concept can satisfy current land-use rules, all access/mitigation conditions, noise buffers, lawful water/fire supply and a real utility service path. Do not equate warehouse or truck/RV approval with data-center entitlement.","moneyVerdict":"HOLD — no paid option/control authorized","facts":[{"label":"Address","value":"4262 E Woodbridge Road","status":"PROJECT IDENTIFICATION","sourceIds":["SJ-CEQA","SJ-PRIOR"]},{"label":"Assemblage","value":"Shared 30.09-acre project with 013-220-58; individual acreage not reconstructed","status":"ONE OPPORTUNITY / TWO PARCEL FILES","sourceIds":["SJ-CEQA","SJ-PRIOR"]},{"label":"Historical zone","value":"I-W in prior official approval review","status":"HISTORICAL — not a DC approval","sourceIds":["SJ-CEQA","SJ-PRIOR"]},{"label":"Asking price","value":"UNKNOWN / obtain current quote; prior captured listing withheld price","status":"UNVERIFIED CURRENT PRICE","sourceIds":["ACA-LIST","SJ-PRIOR"]},{"label":"Available load MW","value":"UNKNOWN; ordinary service is not multi-MW proof","status":"CRITICAL UNKNOWN","sourceIds":["SJ-PRIOR","SJ-POWER"]},{"label":"Third APN discrepancy","value":"013-220-39 appears in prior marketing, not the two-APN approval","status":"CONFLICT","sourceIds":["ACA-LIST","SJ-PRIOR"]}],"sections":[{"title":"Specific access and layout restrictions","body":"The earlier staff-report review identifies a private right-of-way condition through -58 benefiting -13, required before a building permit. Recorded completion and present compliance are not established. The prior review also identifies close residences, agricultural mitigation and opposition to the historical use. Resolve compliance and reserve buffer space before any preliminary data-center layout.","sourceIds":["SJ-PRIOR","SJ-STAFF"]},{"title":"Environmental and water scope","body":"The earlier truck-use initial study described Zone X with 0.2% annual-chance designation, private well/septic and on-site retention; no public water, sewer or storm drainage was established. Those findings are historical and for a different use. Do not label this flood-free, water-secure or Phase-I-cleared.","sourceIds":["SJ-PRIOR","SJ-STUDY"]},{"title":"Current policy","body":"September county direction starts a six-month policy study and leaves a possible October 45-day moratorium for later consideration. No current moratorium is established by that announcement.","sourceIds":["SJ-POLICY"]},{"title":"Desktop source status","body":"Current CEQAnet, planning, policy and GIS resource pages were inspected. The original staff-report and initial-study PDF links were located but not successfully re-retrieved. Parcel-level access and environmental statements above are explicitly inherited from the September 2 packet. No current full-polygon GIS clearance is claimed.","sourceIds":["SJ-CEQA","SJ-PLAN","SJ-GIS","SJ-STAFF","SJ-STUDY","SJ-PRIOR"]}],"factors":[{"label":"Exact transaction definition","weight":20,"value":4,"grade":"V2","rationale":"Official historical project identifiers; current offering and third APN unresolved."},{"label":"Use / entitlement path","weight":15,"value":2,"grade":"V2","rationale":"Industrial history, but no DC approval and changing policy."},{"label":"Parcel-specific power evidence","weight":25,"value":null,"grade":"V0","rationale":"No exact-parcel load-serving commitment."},{"label":"Control receptivity and economics","weight":15,"value":1,"grade":"V1","rationale":"Prior sale/lease marketing only; price and consent not current."},{"label":"Access / civil fit","weight":10,"value":2,"grade":"V2","rationale":"Historical studies identify physical conditions and an unresolved access obligation."},{"label":"Value of the next low-cost test","weight":15,"value":2,"grade":"V2","rationale":"Specific planning/title questions are available, but policy and multi-party dependencies increase burden."}],"checks":[{"id":"identity","topic":"APN, boundary and acreage","status":"CONFLICT","result":"Two official project APNs and combined acreage are identified; marketing adds -39 and no current surveyed offering was obtained.","scope":"PRIOR_REPORT","sourceIds":["SJ-CEQA","ACA-LIST","SJ-PRIOR"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-04","coverageNote":"The source scope is narrower than a current complete-polygon clearance."},{"id":"jurisdiction","topic":"Governing jurisdiction / annexation","status":"FOUND","result":"The historical project was handled by the County for the unincorporated Acampo site. Current boundary remains to be reconfirmed.","scope":"COUNTY_GENERAL","sourceIds":["SJ-CEQA"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-04","coverageNote":"The source scope is narrower than a current complete-polygon clearance."},{"id":"zoning","topic":"Current zoning and proposed-use treatment","status":"FOUND","result":"Historical I-W approval is identified; proposed data-center classification is still unknown.","scope":"PRIOR_REPORT","sourceIds":["SJ-CEQA","SJ-PRIOR"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-04","coverageNote":"The source scope is narrower than a current complete-polygon clearance."},{"id":"plan","topic":"Future land use / comprehensive plan","status":"UNKNOWN","result":"Original adopted designations and conditions must be applied to a new proposed use.","scope":"PRIOR_REPORT","sourceIds":["SJ-STAFF","SJ-PLAN"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-04","coverageNote":"The source scope is narrower than a current complete-polygon clearance."},{"id":"overlays","topic":"Local overlay and special-district inventory","status":"BLOCKED","result":"County GIS portal identified, but no new full-polygon overlay extraction is available.","scope":"NOT_RUN","sourceIds":["SJ-GIS"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-04","coverageNote":"The source scope is narrower than a current complete-polygon clearance."},{"id":"flood","topic":"Floodplain, floodway and drainage","status":"FOUND","result":"Earlier review reports Zone X, 0.2% annual-chance designation and on-site retention.","scope":"PRIOR_REPORT","sourceIds":["SJ-PRIOR","SJ-STUDY"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-04","coverageNote":"Historical truck-use study, not a current flood map determination, survey elevation or buyer flood clearance."},{"id":"roads","topic":"Roads, right-of-way and access","status":"FOUND","result":"Historical approval review identifies access via Highway 99 West Frontage Road and a cross-parcel private ROW condition.","scope":"PRIOR_REPORT","sourceIds":["SJ-PRIOR","SJ-STAFF"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-04","coverageNote":"Road adjacency and a permit condition do not establish current recorded compliance or adequate industrial access."},{"id":"easements","topic":"Recorded/mapped easements and encumbrances","status":"UNKNOWN","result":"Whether the -58-to--13 easement has been recorded and conditions satisfied is unresolved. Obtain instrument and compliance sign-off.","scope":"PRIOR_REPORT","sourceIds":["SJ-PRIOR","SJ-STAFF"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-04","coverageNote":"The source scope is narrower than a current complete-polygon clearance."},{"id":"cases","topic":"Pending cases, ordinances and moratoria","status":"FOUND","result":"County policy study / possible future moratorium found. Track the actual later agenda/order rather than assuming adoption."