ter entitlement.\",\n      \"moneyVerdict\": \"HOLD — no paid option/control authorized\",\n      \"facts\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Address\",\n          \"value\": \"4262 E Woodbridge Road\",\n          \"status\": \"PROJECT IDENTIFICATION\",\n          \"sourceIds\": [\n            \"SJ-CEQA\",\n            \"SJ-PRIOR\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Assemblage\",\n          \"value\": \"Shared 30.09-acre project with 013-220-58; individual acreage not reconstructed\",\n          \"status\": \"ONE OPPORTUNITY / TWO PARCEL FILES\",\n          \"sourceIds\": [\n            \"SJ-CEQA\",\n            \"SJ-PRIOR\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Historical zone\",\n          \"value\": \"I-W in prior official approval review\",\n          \"status\": \"HISTORICAL — not a DC approval\",\n          \"sourceIds\": [\n            \"SJ-CEQA\",\n            \"SJ-PRIOR\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Asking price\",\n          \"value\": \"UNKNOWN / obtain current quote; prior captured listing withheld price\",\n          \"status\": \"UNVERIFIED CURRENT PRICE\",\n          \"sourceIds\": [\n            \"ACA-LIST\",\n            \"SJ-PRIOR\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Available load MW\",\n          \"value\": \"UNKNOWN; ordinary service is not multi-MW proof\",\n          \"status\": \"CRITICAL UNKNOWN\",\n          \"sourceIds\": [\n            \"SJ-PRIOR\",\n            \"SJ-POWER\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Third APN discrepancy\",\n          \"value\": \"013-220-39 appears in prior marketing, not the two-APN approval\",\n          \"status\": \"CONFLICT\",\n          \"sourceIds\": [\n            \"ACA-LIST\",\n            \"SJ-PRIOR\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"sections\": [\n        {\n          \"title\": \"Specific access and layout restrictions\",\n          \"body\": \"The earlier staff-report review identifies a private right-of-way condition through -58 benefiting -13, required before a building permit. Recorded completion and present compliance are not established. The prior review also identifies close residences, agricultural mitigation and opposition to the historical use. Resolve compliance and reserve buffer space before any preliminary data-center layout.\",\n          \"sourceIds\": [\n            \"SJ-PRIOR\",\n            \"SJ-STAFF\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"title\": \"Environmental and water scope\",\n          \"body\": \"The earlier truck-use initial study described Zone X with 0.2% annual-chance designation, private well/septic and on-site retention; no public water, sewer or storm drainage was established. Those findings are historical and for a different use. Do not label this flood-free, water-secure or Phase-I-cleared.\",\n          \"sourceIds\": [\n            \"SJ-PRIOR\",\n            \"SJ-STUDY\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"title\": \"Current policy\",\n          \"body\": \"September county direction starts a six-month policy study and leaves a possible October 45-day moratorium for later consideration. No current moratorium is established by that announcement.\",\n          \"sourceIds\": [\n            \"SJ-POLICY\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"title\": \"Desktop source status\",\n          \"body\": \"Current CEQAnet, planning, policy and GIS resource pages were inspected. The original staff-report and initial-study PDF links were located but not successfully re-retrieved. Parcel-level access and environmental statements above are explicitly inherited from the September 2 packet. No current full-polygon GIS clearance is claimed.\",\n          \"sourceIds\": [\n            \"SJ-CEQA\",\n            \"SJ-PLAN\",\n            \"SJ-GIS\",\n            \"SJ-STAFF\",\n            \"SJ-STUDY\",\n            \"SJ-PRIOR\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n   