lain why marketing includes -39.\",\n          \"decision\": \"Prove the assemblage and clear blocking title/use obligations.\",\n          \"costEstimate\": \"Request existing files at $0; formal title/legal quotes require approval.\",\n          \"approvalRequired\": true,\n          \"done\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ca-sanjoaquin-01322013-a3\",\n          \"order\": 3,\n          \"title\": \"Confirm current offering and cooperation\",\n          \"contact\": \"Rotner & Associates / current listing representative\",\n          \"channel\": \"Use listing contact: https://www.loopnet.com/Listing/19101-N-Highway-99-Acampo-CA/39924284/\",\n          \"question\": \"Are both approved parcels still offered together for sale or long-term lease? What are current terms, included APNs, occupancy, termination rights and owner-authorization conditions?\",\n          \"decision\": \"Determine whether low-cost transferable control is realistic.\",\n          \"costEstimate\": \"$0 desktop / no fee authorized\",\n          \"approvalRequired\": true,\n          \"done\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ca-sanjoaquin-01322013-a4\",\n          \"order\": 4,\n          \"title\": \"Confirm exact serving utility and study-entry conditions\",\n          \"contact\": \"PG&E new-business / large-load intake, subject to exact territory confirmation\",\n          \"channel\": \"Use current PG&E official new-service contact; prior packet lists 1-877-743-7782 (reverify before use)\",\n          \"question\": \"For the two exact APNs and an 8–15 MW first-phase working hypothesis, what study, authorization, tariff, customer-credit and deposit requirements apply? Separate regional upgrades from parcel service.\",\n          \"decision\": \"Identify a sponsor-backed next proof, not a capacity reservation.\",\n          \"costEstimate\": \"No deposit or paid study authorized.\",\n          \"approvalRequired\": true,\n          \"done\": false\n     