": \"Environmental and water scope\",\n          \"body\": \"The earlier truck-use initial study described Zone X with 0.2% annual-chance designation, private well/septic and on-site retention; no public water, sewer or storm drainage was established. Those findings are historical and for a different use. Do not label this flood-free, water-secure or Phase-I-cleared.\",\n          \"sourceIds\": [\n            \"SJ-PRIOR\",\n            \"SJ-STUDY\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"title\": \"Current policy\",\n          \"body\": \"September county direction starts a six-month policy study and leaves a possible October 45-day moratorium for later consideration. No current moratorium is established by that announcement.\",\n          \"sourceIds\": [\n            \"SJ-POLICY\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"title\": \"Desktop source status\",\n          \"body\": \"Current CEQAnet, planning, policy and GIS resource pages were inspected. The original staff-report and initial-study PDF links were located but not successfully re-retrieved. Parcel-level access and environmental statements above are explicitly inherited from the September 2 packet. No current full-polygon GIS clearance is claimed.\",\n          \"sourceIds\": [\n            \"SJ-CEQA\",\n            \"SJ-PLAN\",\n            \"SJ-GIS\",\n            \"SJ-STAFF\",\n            \"SJ-STUDY\",\n            \"SJ-PRIOR\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"factors\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Exact transaction definition\",\n          \"weight\": 20,\n          \"value\": 4,\n          \"grade\": \"V2\",\n          \"rationale\": \"Official historical project identifiers; current offering and third APN unresolved.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Use / entitlement path\",\n          \"weight\": 15,\n          \"value\": 2,\n          \"grade\": \"V2\",\n          \"rationale\": \"Industrial history, but no DC approval and changing policy.\"\n 