pprove a data center or establish current title.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"SJ-PLAN\",\n          \"title\": \"Planning Division and contacts\",\n          \"url\": \"https://www.sjgov.org/department/cdd/planning\",\n          \"publisher\": \"San Joaquin County\",\n          \"date\": \"\",\n          \"retrievedAt\": \"2026-09-04\",\n          \"kind\": \"OFFICIAL\",\n          \"limitation\": \"Current contact and planning resources. Corinne King is listed as Deputy Director of Planning; main number 209-468-2193.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"SJ-GIS\",\n          \"title\": \"County GIS data download portal\",\n          \"url\": \"https://sjmap.org/GISDataDownload.htm\",\n          \"publisher\": \"San Joaquin County GIS\",\n          \"date\": \"\",\n          \"retrievedAt\": \"2026-09-04\",\n          \"kind\": \"OFFICIAL\",\n          \"limitation\": \"Official GIS source discovery, not a completed current parcel overlay intersection.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"SJ-STAFF\",\n          \"title\": \"Staff report, PA-2300130\",\n          \"url\": \"https://www.sjgov.org/commdev/cgi-bin/cdyn.exe/file/APD%20Documents/PA-2300130/Staff%20Report.pdf\",\n          \"publisher\": \"San Joaquin County CDD\",\n          \"date\": \"2024-10-17\",\n          \"retrievedAt\": \"Not re-retrieved; prior review 2026-09-02\",\n          \"kind\": \"OFFICIAL\",\n          \"limitation\": \"The earlier project report reviewed this file. Fresh PDF retrieval failed here; individual conditions below remain inherited pending the original PDF and compliance records.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"SJ-STUDY\",\n          \"title\": \"Initial study, PA-2300130\",\n          \"url\": \"https://www.sjgov.org/commdev/cgi-bin/cdyn.exe/file/APD%20Documents/PA-2300130/Initial%20Study.pdf\",\n          \"publisher\": \"San Joaquin County CDD\",\n          \"date\": \"2024-07-10\",\n          \"retrievedAt\": \"Not re-retrieved; prior review 2026-09-02\",\n          \"kind\": \"OFFICIAL\",\n          \"limitation\": \"Earlier report reviewed a different proposed use. Fresh PDF retrieval failed; not a new environmental, flood or well assessment.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"SJ-PRIOR\",\n          \"title\": \"San Joaquin Unincorporated Parcel Option Screen and accompanying JSON\",\n          \"url\": \"\",\n          \"publisher\": \"Syncranicity project File Library\",\n          \"date\": \"2026-09-02\",\n          \"retrievedAt\": \"2026-09-04\",\n          \"kind\": \"PRIOR_REPORT\",\n          \"limitation\": \"Retained prior dossier including pages 5, 12 and 14. Listings, zoning, contracts and title facts in rejected alternatives need fresh primary-source verification before reopening.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ACA-LIST\",\n          \"title\": \"Acampo sale / long-term lease listing\",\n          \"url\": \"https://www.loopnet.com/Listing/19101-N-Highway-99-Acampo-CA/39924284/\",\n          \"publisher\": \"LoopNet / Rotner & Associates\",\n          \"date\": \"2026-03-26\",\n          \"retrievedAt\": \"Prior capture 2026-09-02\",\n          \"kind\": \"MARKETING\",\n          \"limitation\": \"Prior captured listing, not reverified current. Prior dossier says asking price withheld and lists a third APN, -39. Do not carry forward an unrelated $9.8M price.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"SJ-POWER\",\n          \"title\": \"Northern San Joaquin 230 kV Transmission Project\",\n          \"url\": \"https://ia.cpuc.ca.gov/environment/info/ascent/NSJTP/index.html\",\n          \"publisher\": \"California Public Utilities Commission\",\n          \"date\": \"\",\n          \"retrievedAt\": \"Prior capture 2026-09-02; refresh required\",\n          \"kind\": \"OFFICIAL\",\n          \"limitation\": \"Regional project context. Neither regional modeled capacity nor a line voltage is parcel load headroom. Current NTP status not reverified in this packet.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"actions\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ca-sanjoaquin-01322058-a1\",\n          \"order\": 1,\n          \"title\": \"Resolve data-center classification and policy schedule\",\n          \"contact\": \"San Joaquin County Planning — assigned planner / Corinne King office\",\n          \"channel\": \"209-468-2193; planning@sjgov.org\",\n          \"question\": \"For APNs 013-220-13 and -58, distinguish the existing I-W/truck/RV approvals from the approval needed for an 8–15 MW initial low-water data center. What adopted rules apply today, and what effect would a future moratorium have on a complete application?\",\n          \"decision\": \"Determine whether any bounded entitlement window exists. No assumption of grandfathering.\",\n          \"costEstimate\": \"$0 desktop / no fee authorized\",\n          \"approvalRequired\": true,\n          \"done\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ca-sanjoaquin-01322058-a2\",\n          \"order\": 2,\n          \"title\": \"Retrieve recorded access and condition-compliance evidence\",\n          \"contact\": \"Seller / title company; County case planner\",\n          \"channel\": \"Request existing records for PA-2300130 and related AUPs\",\n          \"question\": \"Provide the recorded ROW benefiting -13 through -58, condition-compliance records, agricultural mitigation satisfaction, current approved plans, leases and legal descriptions. Explain why marketing includes -39.\",\n          \"decision\": \"Prove the assemblage and clear blocking title/use obligations.\",\n          \"costEstimate\": \"Request existing files at $0; formal title/legal quotes require approval.\",\n          \"approvalRequired\": true,\n          \"done\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ca-sanjoaquin-01322058-a3\",\n          \"order\": 3,\n          \"title\": \"Confirm current offering and cooperation\",\n          \"contact\": \"Rotner & Associates / current listing representative\",\n          \"channel\": \"Use listing contact: https://www.loopnet.com/Listing/19101-N-Highway-99-Acampo-CA/39924284/\",\n          \"question\": \"Are both approved parcels still offered together for sale or long-term lease? What are current terms, included APNs, occupancy, termination rights and owner-authorization conditions?\",\n          \"decision\": \"Determine whether low-cost transferable control is realistic.\",\n          \"costEstimate\": \"$0 desktop / no fee authorized\",\n          \"approvalRequired\": true,\n          \"done\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ca-sanjoaquin-01322058-a4\",\n          \"order\": 4,\n          \"title\": \"Confirm exact serving utility and study-entry conditions\",\n          \"contact\": \"PG&E new-business / large-load intake, subject to exact territory confirmation\",\n          \"channel\": \"Use current PG&E official new-service contact; prior packet lists 1-877-743-7782 (reverify before use)\",\n          \"question\": \"For the two exact APNs and an 8–15 MW first-phase working hypothesis, what study, authorization, tariff, customer-credit and deposit requirements apply? Separate regional upgrades from parcel service.\",\n          \"decision\": \"Identify a sponsor-backed next proof, not a capacity reservation.\",\n          \"costEstimate\": \"No deposit or paid study authorized.\",\n          \"approvalRequired\": true,\n          \"done\": false\n        }\n      ],\n      \"geometry\": null,\n      \"geometrySource\": \"\",\n      \"location\": null,\n      \"kill\": null,\n      \"history\": [\n        {\n          \"at\": \"2026-09-04\",\n          \"action\": \"RECOVERED_AND_REVIEWED\",\n          \"note\": \"Original lead retained. Fresh sources, inherited claims and unsuccessful retrievals separated.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"notes\": \"\",\n      \"mapVisible\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"tx-milam-r22018\",\n      \"name\": \"Rockdale — Hwy 77 partial offering\",\n      \"recordType\": \"PARCEL\",\n      \"apn\": \"R22018 (property ID; offered portion unresolved)\",\n      \"state\": \"TX\",\n      \"county\": \"Milam\",\n      \"origin\": \"Recovered prior Syncranicity lead; updated desktop review\",\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-09-04\",\n      \"lifecycle\": \"ACTIVE\",\n      \"summary\": \"Retain this earlier primary lead, but do not treat a marketed approximately 189-acre tract as a verified standalone cadastral parcel. Resolve the offered-part survey, governing jurisdiction and access first. No utility capacity or seller option receptivity is established.\",\n      \"thesis\": \"A legally defined, controllable large tract near an industrial market could justify further work only if development jurisdiction, road rights, flood/drainage constraints and a parcel-specific utility intake path survive the screen.\",\n      \"moneyVerdict\": \"HOLD — no paid option/control authorized\",\n      \"facts\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Offering\",\n          \"value\": \"Approximately 189 acres, TBD S Hwy 77\",\n          \"status\": \"MARKETING\",\n          \"sourceIds\": [\n            \"ROC-LIST\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Property identifier\",\n          \"value\": \"R22018 from prior scan; exact offered-part boundary not obtained\",\n          \"status\": \"INHERITED\",\n          \"sourceIds\": [\n            \"ROC-PRIOR\",\n            \"MILAM-CAD\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Asking terms\",\n          \"value\": \"Obtain current written quote and included legal description\",\n          \"status\": \"UNKNOWN\",\n          \"sourceIds\": [\n            \"ROC-LIST\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Available load MW\",\n          \"value\": \"UNKNOWN\",\n          \"status\": \"CRITICAL UNKNOWN\",\n          \"sourceIds\": []\n        }\n      ],\n      \"sections\": [\n        {\n          \"title\": \"County-first falsification\",\n          \"body\": \"The Milam Appraisal District and the broker offering were identified. The present cadastral parcel record, parent-versus-offered acreage reconciliation and polygon export were not obtained. Marketing language such as unrestricted is not proof of no floodplain, subdivision, extraterritorial, road, title, water or environmental constraints.\",\n          \"sourceIds\": [\n            \"MILAM-CAD\",\n            \"ROC-LIST\",\n            \"ROC-PRIOR\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"title\": \"Commercial test\",\n          \"body\": \"A prior primary-lead label is preserved as history, not carried forward as proof. Obtain the seller-provided survey and low-cost cooperation before evaluating paid control. Buyer mandate, utility territory, MW, timing and large-load deposits remain unknown.\",\n          \"sourceIds\": [\n            \"ROC-PRIOR\",\n            \"ROC-LIST\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"factors\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Exact transaction definition\",\n          \"weight\": 20,\n          \"value\": 2,\n          \"grade\": \"V1\",\n          \"rationale\": \"Prior property ID and current marketing, unresolved tract boundary.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Use / entitlement path\",\n          \"weight\": 15,\n          \"value\": 1,\n          \"grade\": \"V1\",\n          \"rationale\": \"No official project-use classification.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Parcel-specific power evidence\",\n          \"weight\": 25,\n          \"value\": null,\n          \"grade\": \"V0\",\n          \"rationale\": \"No parcel-specific utility path.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Control receptivity and economics\",\n          \"weight\": 15,\n          \"value\": 2,\n          \"grade\": \"V1\",\n          \"rationale\": \"Marketed offering, no verified option cooperation.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\"